Package: superdf
Title: Data Frames with Collection Context
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gaurav Sood", 
           email = "contact@gsood.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Binds observations to a collection roster and versioned declarations
    of measurement, sampling, weighting, and assignment. Validates supported data
    operations and translates explicit analysis requests to established survey
    and experimental estimators. Portable bundles retain data and context together.
